@node Mixin Classes
@section Mixin Classes

@sysname{} provides certain aspects of the behavior of the package system
in the form of mixin classes.  Clients can choose whether to include
those mixin classes as superclasses and thus add or omit the respective
behavior from the package system being defined.

@defclassa{local-nicknames-mixin,@middlepackage{}}

This class is intended to be mixed into client classes that provide the
@ref{Package-local Nicknames} extension.  A client which includes this
class in its superclasses will support the operators and additional
@speclink{f,defpackage} option mentioned in the description of the
extension.
@end deftp
